<title>GERMANY: German Oct producer prices rise 0.2 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>German Oct producer prices rise 0.2 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p>PAN GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES   Oct 96     Sept 96	 Oct 95</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    +0.2	  +0.2	   -0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    -0.3	  -0.6	   +1.6</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  103.8	 103.6	  104.1</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    +0.2	  +0.2	   -0.2</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    -0.4	  -0.8	   +1.6</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  103.4	 103.2	  103.8</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    +0.3	  +0.3	   +0.6</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    +1.3	  +1.6	   +2.0</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  109.2	 108.9	  107.8</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
